invariant: INV-16
file: quic.c
catches: quic_loop_host
reason: a Handshake packet ch_quic_seal seals runs its Poly1305 under
  WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED whatever the session's ch_cfg.cpu states, so the bit
  picks nothing there. The packet is the same. test/quic_loop_widemul.h
  seals and opens a packet at each level each way and requires an end
  whose ch_cfg.cpu holds CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_MULTIPLY to call no file
  under its own names.

--- old
        return quic_packet_seal(widemul_answer(&q->t.cfg), &q->handshake_tx, &q->handshake_hp_tx,
--- new
        return quic_packet_seal(WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, &q->handshake_tx, &q->handshake_hp_tx,
